sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant CLI as rhai-cli
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant GitHub as GitHub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>stdio / 8080/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Lint / Upgrade Readiness
        User->>CLI: kubectl odh lint --target-version X.Y
        CLI->>K8sAPI: GET CRDs, resources<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Cluster state
        CLI->>K8sAPI: GET CRD discovery<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: API extensions
        CLI-->>User: Readiness report (table/JSON/YAML)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,GitHub: Flow 2: Dependency Management
        User->>CLI: kubectl odh deps list/install
        CLI->>GitHub: GET raw.githubusercontent.com<br/>values.yaml, Chart.yaml at pinned commit
        GitHub-->>CLI: Dependency manifests
        CLI->>K8sAPI: GET CSVs, Subscriptions<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: OLM resources
        CLI->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE resources<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Applied
        CLI-->>User: Dependency status
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Agent,K8sAPI: Flow 3: MCP Server (Agent Integration)
        Agent->>CLI: JSON-RPC tool call<br/>stdio or SSE/8080
        CLI->>K8sAPI: Resource operations<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Response
        CLI-->>Agent: JSON-RPC result<br/>stdio or SSE/8080
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over User,TrustyAI: Flow 4: TrustyAI Migration
        User->>CLI: kubectl odh migrate --phase pre-upgrade
        CLI->>K8sAPI: GET Route for TrustyAI<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Route URL
        CLI->>TrustyAI: GET/POST metrics<br/>HTTPS InsecureSkipVerify<br/>Auth: Bearer token
        TrustyAI-->>CLI: Metric data
        CLI-->>User: Migration result
    end
